# A double-click in a prompt's line takes the word under the pointer,
# and the next typed character replaces it (`text_field.clickSelect`).
# Three presses take the whole line. The Search sessions prompt is a
# plain one: its box sits on row 13, the line starts at column 32.
command ai.search_sessions
type aaaa bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb cccc
doubleclick 45 13
type Z
expect screen contains "aaaa Z cccc"
click 33 13
doubleclick 33 13
type q
expect screen contains "│ q "
expect screen lacks "cccc"
